Compilation flags:
========================================
Enable : MODEL=HYDRO, EOS=MODEL=HYDRO, BAROTROPIC, GRAVITY
Disable: COMOVING


Default setup:
========================================
1. Units:
       [L   ] = AU
       [Mass] = Msun
       [Time] = kyr

   (2) Internal (for all other input files and internal usage):
       [L   ] = kpc
       [v   ] = 1e3 km/s
       [Dens] = 5.0e-25 g/cm^3
    -->[Time] = [L]/[v] ~ 0.978 Myr ~ 1.0 Myr
    -->[Mass] = [Dens]*[L]^3 ~ 7.4e6 Msun


Note:
========================================
1. The rotation axis is assumed to align with the z-direction.
